@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Nutzer" as User
participant "Angular Frontend\n(Chart.js)" as UI
participant "Core API (Backend)" as Backend
database "Meta-PostgreSQL" as MetaDB
database "TimescaleDB" as TSDB

User -> UI : Zeitraum wählen (z. B. 1 Jahr)
UI -> Backend : GET /api/measurements/charts/data\n?id&from&to
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend : ChartResolution:\nBucket = range/1500\n(Raw falls <= 1h)
Backend -> MetaDB : jOOQ: date_bin + avg(norm_value)\nWHERE sensor_parameter_id + timestamp-Range\n(sensor_reading_secured, RLS)
activate MetaDB

MetaDB -> MetaDB : can_access_sensor() (RLS)
MetaDB -> TSDB : FDW: Filter-Pushdown\n(sensor_parameter_id, timestamp)
TSDB --> MetaDB : gefilterte Rohzeilen
deactivate TSDB
MetaDB -> MetaDB : Aggregat auf <=1500 Buckets
MetaDB --> Backend : aggregiertes Resultset
deactivate MetaDB

Backend --> UI : JSON (max. ~1500 Punkte)
deactivate Backend

UI -> UI : Chart.js rendert
UI --> User : Chart

@enduml
